Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: libtiff/tif_pixarlog.c
Line: 433
Function: horizontalAccumulate8
Bug type: out-of-bounds-write
CWE: CWE-787
Explanation: The else-branch calls REPEAT(stride, ...) at line 433. With stride == 0, the REPEAT macro runs once, n is not decreased, and the while (n > 0) loop (lines 435–441) becomes infinite while incrementing/dereferencing wp/op, causing out-of-bounds reads/writes.

